{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"PCA with varimax rotation of GI parameters from trials without FOG (1,130 trials) revealed 5 orthogonally RPC accounting for 73% of variance (see Fig 2C and Supplementary Fig S2).\",\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups (Supplementary Fig S3).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"In the 12 FOG-OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG-OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G). These FOG-OBS patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG-OBS− trials; see Fig 1E).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG-OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG-OBS− trials) in FOG-OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"We observed stronger negative associations between high-beta band power and pace (RPC1) score in FOG-OBS-positive versus FOG-OBS-negative trials, significant only in the posterior STN (see Fig 6A–C and Supplementary Fig S6).\",\n    \"In contrast, positive association between rhythm (RPC2) and both high-beta and theta band activity emerged in the posterior STN for FOG-OBS-positive trials but were absent or reversed in FOG-OBS-negative trials (see Fig 6D–F).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\",\n    \"FOG-OBS patients with PD show early, identifiable changes in GI and STN activity patterns up to 19 seconds before FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有部分依据，但整体定性不完整。原文确实首先对没有发生FOG的试次进行了大量分析，并将这些结果解释为FOG易感性相关的神经活动特征（predisposition）。然而，原文并未局限于无冻结试次。Results第218节Predictive Patterns of FOG Occurrence明确对同一批12名FOG-OBS患者的99个FOG阳性试次与212个FOG阴性试次进行了直接比较，99个阳性试次中共识别出263次实际FOG事件。研究进一步发现，在后续实际发生FOG的阳性试次中，步态启动阶段posterior STN的high-beta与pace呈更强负向关联，而posterior STN的high-beta和theta与rhythm呈阳性关联；这些关联在阴性试次中不存在或方向相反。原文Discussion第299节及Conclusions也明确将这些结果解释为FOG发生前的变化。因此，指控者的描述有全文明确依据。需要保留一个重要限定：这些电生理关联是在实际发生冻结的试次中、冻结可观察起始之前的步态启动阶段测得的，属于真实FOG事件的前瞻性关联证据，而不是冻结发生瞬间的电生理记录。最终判断：report_supported为partly，因为报告正确指出了无冻结试次的易感性分析，但将研究证据归类为易感性证据而非真实冻结事件相关证据，遗漏了原文明确报告的FOG阳性试次比较及其关键结果；judge_supported为yes。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bf6e8c99-1025-40da-9bbf-31a97e8fdb04", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200423742159Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:05:22.153003+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ad1b5b38ad250e9d2dd775607ce4b9d0617201a0b010030fbe016ba26f639608", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p